<title>USA: AMEX to list two more flex options next week.</title>
<headline>AMEX to list two more flex options next week.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The American Stock Exchange (AMEX) said it will list equity flexible exchange options on American Express Company and Texaco Inc beginning Thursday, October 24.</p>
<p>American Express and Texaco Inc will join 13 other previously announced stocks for listing of E-FLEX options October 24.</p>
<p>--Reuters Derivatives Desk</p>
</text>
